# Never commit: drafts, private reply text, and anything derived from real
# session transcripts. Only the reproducible harness belongs in the repo.
# Mirrors splitrail-validation/.gitignore.
work/
out/
*.log

# Write-ups and correspondence stay local until published elsewhere.
# Patterns without a slash match at any depth; anchored ones would not.
DEVTO_*.md
ISSUE_DRAFT.md
PR_BODY.md
REVIEW_REPLY.md
REPLY_*.md
STEPS.md
prepare_pr.sh
